@{
    ViewData["Title"] = L["Legal.Terms.Title"].Value;
}

<div class="legal-page">
    <h1 class="legal-page__title">@L["Legal.Terms.Title"]</h1>
    <partial name="_EnglishOnlyNotice" />

    <div lang="en">
        <p class="text-muted">Last updated: October 2026</p>

        <section class="legal-section">
            <h2>Acceptance of Terms</h2>
            <p>By accessing or using the PersonalFinance web application (the "Service"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, do not use the Service.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
            <h2>Description of Service</h2>
            <p>PersonalFinance is a personal finance management tool that allows you to track budgets, monitor net worth, set savings goals, and analyze your financial data. The Service may include integration with third-party services such as Google Drive.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
            <h2>Account Responsibilities</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials</li>
                <li>You are responsible for all activity under your account</li>
                <li>You must notify us immediately of any unauthorized use</li>
                <li>You must be at least 16 years old to create an account</li>
                <li>You may not create more than one personal account</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
            <h2>Acceptable Use</h2>
            <p>You agree not to:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Use the Service for any illegal purpose</li>
                <li>Violate any applicable laws or regulations</li>
                <li>Attempt to gain unauthorized access to the Service or other user accounts</li>
                <li>Interfere with the proper working of the Service</li>
                <li>Use automated means to access the Service without permission</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
            <h2>Your Data</h2>
            <p>The financial data you enter into the Service is your data. You retain all rights to your data. We process it solely to provide the Service to you. You can download your data or delete your account at any time on the <a asp-area="Identity" asp-page="/Account/Manage/PersonalData">Personal data</a> page.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
            <h2>Intellectual Property</h2>
            <p>The Service, including its design, code, and branding, is owned by PersonalFinance and protected by intellectual property laws. Your content (financial data, community posts) remains yours, but you grant us a license to store and display it for the purpose of providing the Service.</p>
            <p>The 3D view of Stanton, California on the home page is drawn from OpenStreetMap data, © <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright" target="_blank" rel="noopener">OpenStreetMap contributors</a>, available under the Open Database License (ODbL). The extract is not owned by PersonalFinance.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
            <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>
            <p>The Service is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. We do not guarantee that the Service will be uninterrupted, secure, or error-free. To the maximum extent permitted by law, we shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising from your use of the Service.</p>
            <p><strong>Important:</strong> See our <a asp-controller="Legal" asp-action="Disclaimer">Financial Disclaimer</a> for details about financial advice.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
            <h2>Termination</h2>
            <p>We may suspend or terminate your account if you violate these terms. You may delete your account at any time on the <a asp-area="Identity" asp-page="/Account/Manage/PersonalData">Personal data</a> page. Your data is hidden straight away and permanently deleted within 31 days, unless you cancel it in the first 30 days with the link we email you. See our <a asp-controller="Legal" asp-action="Privacy">Privacy Policy</a> for details.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
            <h2>Changes to These Terms</h2>
            <p>We may update these Terms from time to time. We will notify you of material changes. Your continued use of the Service after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
            <h2>Contact</h2>
            <p>For questions about these Terms, please contact us via our <a asp-controller="Legal" asp-action="Contact">Contact page</a>.</p>
        </section>
    </div>
</div>
